Diff a git range

USAGE
  lookma [OPTIONS] [RANGE]
       lookma [OPTIONS] [RANGE] <COMMAND>

COMMANDS
  review        Review a range hunk by hunk
  stat          Summarize a range by file
  export        Write the review to a file
  help          Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

ARGUMENTS
  RANGE         Git range to diff, e.g. main..HEAD

OPTIONS
  --staged                   Diff the staged changes
  -v                         Raise the detail level
  --threshold <RATIO>        Move/rename similarity threshold
  -c, --color <BOOL>         Enable ANSI color
                             possible values: true, false
  -p, --pattern <pattern>    Only diff paths matching this glob
  --summary <STYLE>          How much of each change to describe
                             default: brief
                             possible values: brief, full, none
  --output <MODE>            Output format
                             default: auto
                             possible values: auto, term, text, term-debug, json, yaml, xml, csv, ndjson
  --output-file-path <PATH>  Write output to file instead of stdout
  -h, --help                 Print help (see more with '--help')

LEARN MORE
  naming        Naming
  ranges        Ranges
